  {
   "key": "script:0050:071D",
   "src": "c96e7a54863d",
   "t": "<FACE:03>(Ah, cierto, esto…)"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0050:072C",
   "src": "f80838768833",
   "t": "<FACE:00>Creo que era…<WAIT>¿la «Linterna<NL>semieterna»?<WAIT><FACE:02>Lo que me da Hiyori<NL>a veces sí sirve"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0050:076A",
   "src": "5ef158564970",
   "t": "<FACE:04>(¿Una Medalla…?)<NL><WAIT>(¿Qué será este<NL>dibujo…?<WAIT>¿La larva de algo…?)"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0050:0798",
   "src": "8e97a2b9ba71",
   "t": "<FACE:12>¡Oye, tú!<NL>¡¿Qué estás<WAIT>haciendo?!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0050:07AC",
   "src": "588e3c707bb3",
   "t": "<FACE:03>¡Ay! ¡Justo cuando más<NL>la necesito!<WAIT><FACE:01>¡Por eso no es de fiar<NL>lo que ella me da!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0050:07DE",
   "src": "977afac4439e",
   "t": "<FACE:03>¡Ah!<NL><WAIT>Usted es el famoso<NL>medaguerrero…<WAIT>Murasame Shiden…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0050:0803",
   "src": "d49bdf03aafc",
   "t": "<FACE:0F>¿Mm?<NL><WAIT>Eso aparte, allá al<NL>fondo hay una luz…<WAIT>Echemos un vistazo…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0050:082E",
   "src": "3a7241fc4127",
   "t": "<FACE:12>(¡Esto es…!)"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0050:083A",
   "src": "07df08d93e87",
   "t": "<FACE:00>Mistral…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0050:0845",
   "src": "b49c52df1e3b",
   "t": "<FACE:12>¿Qué?<WAIT><FACE:00>Es el nombre de<NL>este Medabot<WAIT>Lo acabo de oír<NL>en mi cabeza"
